),\n        _ => (c2V(0.0, 0.0), c2V(0.0, 0.0)),\n    }\n}\n\npub extern \"C\" fn c2CircletoCapsule(A: c2Circle, B: c2Capsule) -> c_int {\n    let n = c2Sub(B.b, B.a);\n    let ap = c2Sub(A.p, B.a);\n    let da = c2Dot(ap, n);\n    let d2;\n    if da < 0.0 {\n        d2 = c2Dot(ap, ap);\n    } else {\n        let db = c2Dot(c2Sub(A.p, B.b), n);\n        if db < 0.0 {\n            let e = c2Sub(ap, c2Mulvs(n, divss(da, c2Dot(n, n))));\n            d2 = c2Dot(e, e);\n        } else {\n            let bp = c2Sub(A.p, B.b);\n            d2 = c2Dot(bp, bp);\n        }\n    }\n    let r = addss(B.r, A.r);\n    (d2 < mulss(r, r)) as c_int\n}\n```\n\nOne note: the sole remaining bare float multiply in the file is `C2_EPSILON * C2_EPSILON` in `c2GJK`'s termination check (line 760). It is not in the rewrite table and both operands are finite compile-time constants, so it can never see a NaN — left as is.","usage":{"total_tokens":49730,"tool_uses":28,"duration_ms":137234},"uuid":"8f7296d9-d323-4833-81fc-1e8fe74e3c0a","session_id":"36197e55-e2d7-4aeb-bb1e-b807856a26ea"}
