y 32-bit patterns**: normals, ±0.0, denormals, ±inf, quiet NaNs, signalling NaNs (`0x7f80_0001..`) — 4,000,000 cases | [x] |\n| 93 | `c22`, `c23`, `c2D`, `c2L`, `c2Witness`, `c2GJKSimplexMetric`, `c2Support`, `c2BBVerts`, `c2MakeProxy` | simplex fields and `count` from arbitrary bit patterns (`count` incl. 0/1/2/3/4/-1/random) — 1,600,000 cases | [x] |\n| 94 | `c2GJK` | arbitrary-bit shapes × all 9 type pairs × 5 transform kinds × random `use_radius` × cache none/zeroed/hand-made × 1-3 **chained** calls sharing one cache × random out-pointer nullability — 959,052 cases | [x] |\n| 95 | `c2Collided` + all six predicates | arbitrary-bit shapes over the full 3×3 grid — 1,050,000 cases | [x] |\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nPY\ngrep -c '^| [0-9]' CONFIGS.md","description":"Add NaN-class rows to CONFIGS.md"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4528,"cache_read_input_tokens":281047,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4528,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"36197e55-e2d7-4aeb-bb1e-b807856a26ea","uuid":"a53e5113-6eaa-4e11-9d1d-7de9e81b6932","timestamp":"2026-09-05T06:06:00.010Z"}
